==Battleground==
*7 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lost World Yuki (Enemy)|Lost World Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

